<PageTitle>Preschool | Miss Mary's Little Lambs</PageTitle>
<article class="information-page">
    <h1>Preschool</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">8:00 am &ndash; 11:00 am &middot; Ages 3&ndash;5</p>
    <div class="program-grid">
        <section>
            <h2>Little Lambs Early Learning</h2><p class="page-subtitle">Ages 3 &amp; 4 · Foundations through play</p>
            <ul><li>Pre-reading &amp; phonics exposure</li><li>Early math concepts through hands-on exploration</li><li>Fine and gross motor development</li><li>Social-emotional growth and peer interaction</li><li>Art, music, and imaginative play</li></ul>
            <p>A gentle rhythm filled with movement, curiosity, and joyful discovery.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2>Kindergarten Foundations</h2><p class="page-subtitle">Ages 4 &amp; 5 · Confident, kindergarten-ready learners</p>
            <ul><li>Letter sounds &amp; early reading skills</li><li>Number sense &amp; problem-solving</li><li>Writing readiness &amp; fine motor strength</li><li>Nature-based science and exploration</li></ul>
            <p>A calm, unhurried approach that builds confidence and a love of learning.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
    <section>
        <h2>Academic Tutoring</h2><p class="page-subtitle">Elementary &amp; Middle School · Building skills, confidence, and a love of learning</p>
        <ul><li>Strengthening reading skills (phonics, fluency, comprehension)</li><li>Building math confidence and problem-solving skills</li><li>Supporting writing and clear expression</li><li>Developing study habits and organization</li><li>Gentle guidance with homework and test preparation</li></ul>
        <p>A patient, encouraging approach that helps each child feel capable, supported, and successful.</p>
    </section>
